  "prefLabel": "Jus 1602.02 Collection event",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1602.02 \"Collection event\" means a one-day program through which the public can safely dispose of unused or expired pharmaceutical drugs from a household or residence that are no longer wanted or needed by the consumer, at a secure collection site.\n\nSource. #10177, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13551, eff 2-2-23",
